  "description": "1-14. **Hwansangeun Bame Jaranda** (환상은 밤에 자란다, Visions of the Night)\n*Can you trust what you see?*\nLio lost everything she held dear when her home burned down and her grandmother went missing in a suspicious incident years ago. Now, left with nothing to trust but her mysterious powers of illusion, she hopes to discover the truth of her tragic past in a world where nothing is what it seems to be.\n\n15-22. **Sinui Jib** (신의 집; The House in the Woods)\n*\"This can't be happening. Let me out!\"*\nA young man happens upon a mysterious house in the woods and is chosen as its warden. Much to his horror, however, he learns that he is forever trapped inside, and the only way to be free is to lure in a replacement—an impossible feat that must be accomplished from within the confines of the house.\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes 1 prologue chapter.*",
